{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/Logo.png?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swamp Keeper is a top-down Korean-style bow action arena shooter inspired by one-shot, one-kill mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the keeper of a sacred swamp, stopping invaders with only your bow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your archery and defeat enemy forces and their commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/01.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ho\u2019s forces have invaded the sacred swamp, targeting its precious resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wielding iron and fire, the enemy has already reached the heart of the swamp shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the sworn guardian of these wetlands, it\u2019s your duty to drive them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/02.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With support from your allies, traverse the battlefield and restore peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/03.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pull, aim, release \u2014 experience the high-stakes tension of one-shot, one-kill charging bow action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/04.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft arrows that suit your style, select your skills, and prepare for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/05.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy charming Korean-style anthropomorphic characters and beautifully rendered backgrounds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799650?t=1749878495","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799650?t=1749878495","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/b5162e391680ec2ab23eedf10d438dc0d8a0d387/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749878495","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/b5162e391680ec2ab23eedf10d438dc0d8a0d387/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749878495","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/Logo.png?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swamp Keeper is a top-down Korean-style bow action arena shooter inspired by one-shot, one-kill mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the keeper of a sacred swamp, stopping invaders with only your bow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your archery and defeat enemy forces and their commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/01.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ho\u2019s forces have invaded the sacred swamp, targeting its precious resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wielding iron and fire, the enemy has already reached the heart of the swamp shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the sworn guardian of these wetlands, it\u2019s your duty to drive them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/02.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With support from your allies, traverse the battlefield and restore peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/03.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pull, aim, release \u2014 experience the high-stakes tension of one-shot, one-kill charging bow action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/04.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft arrows that suit your style, select your skills, and prepare for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/extras/05.gif?t=1749878495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy charming Korean-style anthropomorphic characters and beautifully rendered backgrounds.</p>","developers":["Maetdol Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3689390","name":"Swamp Keeper"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799650/52224bf332131be2e1d7b12c608eac6658627241/header.jpg?t=1749878